SUMMARY:Kurt Elling & Yellowjackets Celebrate Weather Report
LOCATION:Hart Plaza - Carhartt Amphitheater Stage
DESCRIPTION:Detroit Jazz Fest 2026. Grammy-winning vocalist Kurt Elling joins the long-running fusion band Yellowjackets for a tribute to Weather Report\, the influential jazz-fusion group co-led by Joe Zawinul and Wayne Shorter in the 1970s and '80s.
END:VEVENT
